        "html": "<!--\n  NOTA DE ENTREGA\n  ───────────────\n  Este bloco foi desenvolvido para ser colado diretamente em uma página do Shopify,\n  dentro do editor de conteúdo ou de uma seção de HTML personalizado.\n\n  NÃO inclui header, menu de navegação, barra superior, footer ou rodapé.\n\n  IMAGENS: algumas imagens de cases ainda usam placeholder. Substitua pelos URLs reais da Hyper Island.\n  LINKS: todos os links principais estão preenchidos com URLs reais. Verifique antes de publicar.\n  FORMULÁRIO: já integrado com HubSpot (portalId 1588780, formId ba1144b5-f5a2-45e2-ad47-a6ce34de1715).\n-->\n\n<style>\n/* Montserrat via Google Fonts — usado em subtítulos, textos, botões e números grandes */\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap');\n\n/* ============================================================\n   HYPER ISLAND · HOME REDESIGN\n   Estilos completamente escopados em .hi-home-redesign\n   Não alteram o tema global do Shopify\n   ============================================================ */\n\n.hi-home-redesign *,\n.hi-home-redesign *::before,\n.hi-home-redesign *::after {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\n.hi-home-redesign {\n  --color-black: #111111;\n  --color-black-deep: #000000;\n  --color-white: #FFFFFF;\n  --color-bg-light: #F5F5F2;\n  --color-text-secondary: #666666;\n  --color-border: #D9D9D6;\n  --color-orange: #FF7300;\n  --color-orange-soft: #FFF1E6;\n  --color-text-main: #333333;\n\n  --font-main: 'Montserrat', inherit, sans-serif;\n  --font-heading: inherit;\n\n  --radius-sm: 2px;\n  --radius-btn: 100px;\n  --radius-md: 4px;\n\n  --transition: 0.22s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n\n  font-family: var(--font-main);\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  overflow-x: hidden;\n}\n\n/* ── CONTAINER ── */\n.hi-container {\n  max-width: 1240px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 40px;\n}\n\n/* ── UTILITY ── */\n.hi-eyebrow {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.hi-reveal {\n  opacity: 0;\n  transform: translateY(28px);\n  transition: opacity 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),\n              transform 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n}\n.hi-reveal.hi-visible {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: translateY(0);\n}\n.hi-reveal-delay-1 { transition-delay: 0.1s; }\n.hi-reveal-delay-2 { transition-delay: 0.2s; }\n.hi-reveal-delay-3 { transition-delay: 0.3s; }\n.hi-reveal-delay-4 { transition-delay: 0.4s; }\n\n/* ── BUTTONS ── */\n.hi-btn {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  font-family: var(--font-main);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  padding: 14px 28px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-btn);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  border: 2px solid transparent;\n}\n.hi-btn-primary {\n  background: var(--color-black);\n  color: var(--color-white);\n  border-color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-btn-primary:hover {\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  border-color: var(--color-orange);\n  color: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-btn-outline {\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  border-color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-btn-outline:hover {\n  background: var(--color-black);\n  color: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-btn-orange {\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  color: var(--color-white);\n  border-color: var(--color-orange);\n}\n.hi-btn-orange:hover {\n  background: var(--color-black);\n  border-color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-btn-white {\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  border-color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-btn-white:hover {\n  background: var(--color-black);\n  color: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-link-tertiary {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-link-tertiary:hover {\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n}\n.hi-link-tertiary::after {\n  content: '→';\n  font-size: 15px;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   1. HERO — DESKTOP: vídeo background | MOBILE: grid com imagem\n   ============================================================ */\n\n/* ── BASE (compartilhado) ── */\n.hi-hero {\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.hi-hero__title {\n  font-size: clamp(52px, 7.5vw, 96px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 28px;\n}\n.hi-hero__title em {\n  font-style: normal;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n}\n\n.hi-hero__ctas {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n/* ── DESKTOP (≥ 769px): hero com vídeo fullscreen ── */\n@media (min-width: 769px) {\n\n  .hi-hero {\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    background: #000;\n  }\n\n  /* Vídeo de fundo */\n  .hi-hero__video {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    object-position: center center;\n    z-index: 0;\n    filter: saturate(0.75) brightness(0.9);\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  /* Overlay gradiente */\n  .hi-hero__overlay {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    z-index: 1;\n    background: linear-gradient(\n      105deg,\n      rgba(0,0,0,0.80) 0%,\n      rgba(0,0,0,0.55) 50%,\n      rgba(0,0,0,0.18) 100%\n    );\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  /* Linha laranja na base */\n  .hi-hero__bottom-line {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;\n    height: 3px;\n    background: var(--color-orange);\n    z-index: 3;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  /* Inner: ocupa 100vh, alinha conteúdo à esquerda verticalmente centrado */\n  .hi-hero__inner {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: flex-start;\n    padding: 120px 0 100px;\n  }\n\n  .hi-hero__inner .hi-container {\n    width: 100%;\n    text-align: left !important;\n    display: block !important;\n  }\n\n  .hi-hero__content {\n    max-width: 680px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    text-align: left;\n    margin-left: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* Eyebrow com traço laranja */\n  .hi-hero__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.22em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--color-orange);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 28px;\n    opacity: 0.9;\n  }\n  .hi-hero__eyebrow::before {\n    content: '';\n    display: block;\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 2px;\n    background: var(--color-orange);\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  .hi-hero__title {\n    color: var(--color-white);\n  }\n\n  .hi-hero__subtitle {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78);\n    max-width: 520px;\n    margin-bottom: 44px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  /* Botão primário no hero escuro: branco sólido */\n  .hi-hero .hi-btn-primary {\n    background: var(--color-white);\n    color: var(--color-black);\n    border-color: var(--color-white);\n  }\n  .hi-hero .hi-btn-primary:hover {\n    background: var(--color-orange);\n    border-color: var(--color-orange);\n    color: var(--color-white);\n  }\n\n  /* Botão outline no hero escuro: borda/texto brancos */\n  .hi-hero .hi-btn-outline {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--color-white);\n    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);\n  }\n  .hi-hero .hi-btn-outline:hover {\n    background: var(--color-white);\n    color: var(--color-black);\n    border-color: var(--color-white);\n  }\n\n  /* Badge flutuante inferior direito */\n  .hi-hero__badge {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 28px;\n    right: 0;\n    z-index: 3;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);\n  }\n  .hi-hero__badge::before {\n    content: '';\n    display: block;\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: var(--color-orange);\n  }\n\n  /* Indicador de scroll */\n  .hi-hero__scroll {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 32px;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    z-index: 3;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    opacity: 0.45;\n  }\n  .hi-hero__scroll-line {\n    width: 1px;\n    height: 40px;\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, var(--color-white));\n    animation: hiScrollPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n  }\n\n  /* Elementos mobile ocultos no desktop */\n  .hi-hero__image-col { display: none; }\n}\n\n@keyframes hiScrollPulse {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scaleY(0.7); transform-origin: top; }\n  50%       { opacity: 1;   transform: scaleY(1);   transform-origin: top; }\n}\n\n/* ── MOBILE (≤ 768px): hero original com grid + imagem ── */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n\n  .hi-hero {\n    padding: 48px 0 0;\n  }\n\n  /* Ocultar tudo que é exclusivo do desktop */\n  .hi-hero__video,\n  .hi-hero__overlay,\n  .hi-hero__bottom-line,\n  .hi-hero__badge,\n  .hi-hero__scroll { display: none; }\n\n  /* Inner vira layout simples sem flex especial */\n  .hi-hero__inner {\n    display: block;\n    min-height: unset;\n    padding: 0;\n    position: static;\n    z-index: auto;\n  }\n\n  .hi-hero__inner .hi-container {\n    display: block !important;\n    text-align: left !important;\n  }\n\n  /* Grid mobile: imagem em cima, conteúdo embaixo */\n  .hi-hero__mobile-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  .hi-hero__image-col {\n    display: block;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    height: 260px;\n    order: 1;\n  }\n\n  .hi-hero__img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    display: block;\n    filter: grayscale(15%);\n    transition: filter 0.4s ease;\n  }\n  .hi-hero__img:hover { filter: grayscale(0%); }\n\n  .hi-hero__badge-mobile {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 28px;\n    left: 28px;\n    background: var(--color-orange);\n    color: var(--color-white);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    padding: 8px 16px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    z-index: 2;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .hi-hero__content {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 40px 0 60px;\n    order: 2;\n  }\n\n  /* Eyebrow mobile: estilo original (sem traço) */\n  .hi-hero__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--color-orange);\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .hi-hero__eyebrow::before { display: none; }\n\n  .hi-hero__title {\n    font-size: clamp(48px, 10vw, 68px);\n    color: var(--color-black);\n  }\n\n  .hi-hero__subtitle {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n    max-width: 480px;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n\n  /* Botões no mobile: estilos padrão (fundo escuro) */\n  .hi-hero .hi-btn-primary {\n    background: var(--color-black);\n    color: var(--color-white);\n    border-color: var(--color-black);\n    width: 100%;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .hi-hero .hi-btn-primary:hover {\n    background: var(--color-orange);\n    border-color: var(--color-orange);\n  }\n  .hi-hero .hi-btn-outline {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--color-black);\n    border-color: var(--color-black);\n    width: 100%;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .hi-hero .hi-btn-outline:hover {\n    background: var(--color-black);\n    color: var(--color-white);\n  }\n\n  .hi-hero__ctas { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }\n}\n\n/* Reduced motion */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .hi-hero__video { animation: none; }\n  .hi-hero__scroll-line { animation: none; }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   2. BARRA DE PERFIL\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-profiles {\n  padding: 80px 0;\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-profiles__header {\n  margin-bottom: 48px;\n}\n.hi-profiles__title {\n  font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 38px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n}\n.hi-profiles__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 0;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-profile-card {\n  padding: 40px 36px;\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.hi-profile-card:last-child {\n  border-right: none;\n}\n.hi-profile-card::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;\n  height: 3px;\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  transform: scaleX(0);\n  transform-origin: left;\n  transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n}\n.hi-profile-card:hover::before {\n  transform: scaleX(1);\n}\n.hi-profile-card:hover {\n  background: var(--color-bg-light);\n}\n.hi-profile-card__num {\n  font-size: 48px;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  color: var(--color-border);\n  line-height: 1;\n  letter-spacing: -0.04em;\n}\n.hi-profile-card__title {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-profile-card__text {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  flex: 1;\n}\n.hi-profile-card__link {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-profile-card__link::after {\n  content: '→';\n}\n.hi-profile-card__link:hover {\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   3. BUSINESS TRANSFORMATION\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-b2b {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-bg-light);\n}\n.hi-b2b__top {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 60px;\n  align-items: end;\n  margin-bottom: 64px;\n}\n.hi-b2b__title {\n  font-size: clamp(32px, 3.5vw, 52px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n}\n.hi-b2b__intro {\n  padding-top: 8px;\n}\n.hi-b2b__intro p {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n}\n.hi-b2b__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 0;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-b2b-card {\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  padding: 36px 28px;\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 14px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-b2b-card:last-child { border-right: none; }\n.hi-b2b-card:hover {\n  background: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-b2b-card:hover .hi-b2b-card__title,\n.hi-b2b-card:hover .hi-b2b-card__text {\n  color: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-b2b-card__portfolio {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  padding: 8px 0 0;\n  opacity: 0;\n  transform: translateY(6px);\n  transition: opacity 0.22s ease, transform 0.22s ease;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n.hi-b2b-card__portfolio::after { content: '↗'; font-size: 13px; }\n.hi-b2b-card--has-portfolio:hover .hi-b2b-card__portfolio {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: translateY(0);\n  pointer-events: auto;\n}\n.hi-b2b-card__marker {\n  width: 28px;\n  height: 3px;\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  border-radius: 2px;\n}\n.hi-b2b-card__title {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-b2b-card__text {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  flex: 1;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-b2b__cta {\n  margin-top: 48px;\n  padding-top: 48px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n.hi-b2b__cta-text {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  max-width: 500px;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   4. CASES\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-cases {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-cases__header {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 60px;\n  align-items: end;\n  margin-bottom: 60px;\n}\n.hi-cases__title {\n  font-size: clamp(30px, 3.2vw, 48px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n}\n.hi-cases__intro {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n}\n.hi-cases__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n.hi-case-card {\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-case-card:hover {\n  border-color: var(--color-orange);\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n}\n.hi-case-card__img {\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n  filter: grayscale(60%);\n  transition: filter 0.4s ease;\n}\n.hi-case-card:hover .hi-case-card__img {\n  filter: grayscale(0%);\n}\n.hi-case-card__body {\n  padding: 28px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n  flex: 1;\n}\n.hi-case-card__meta {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n.hi-case-card__company {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-case-card__cat {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n  background: var(--color-orange-soft);\n  padding: 3px 8px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n}\n.hi-case-card__text {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  flex: 1;\n}\n.hi-case-card__link {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-case-card__link::after { content: '→'; }\n.hi-case-card__link:hover { color: var(--color-orange); }\n\n/* ============================================================\n   5. CURSOS\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-courses {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: #000000;\n  color: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-courses__header {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 60px;\n  align-items: end;\n  margin-bottom: 72px;\n  padding-bottom: 48px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n}\n.hi-courses__eyebrow {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n.hi-courses__title {\n  font-size: clamp(30px, 3.5vw, 52px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  color: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-courses__intro {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\n  padding-top: 4px;\n}\n.hi-trail {\n  margin-bottom: 40px;\n}\n.hi-trail:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 0; }\n.hi-trail__title {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  padding-bottom: 12px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n}\n.hi-trail__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n.hi-course-card {\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-course-card:hover {\n  border-color: var(--color-orange);\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n}\n.hi-course-card__img-wrap {\n  position: relative;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.hi-course-card__img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n  filter: grayscale(30%) brightness(0.85);\n  transition: filter 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s ease;\n}\n.hi-course-card:hover .hi-course-card__img {\n  filter: grayscale(0%) brightness(1);\n  transform: scale(1.04);\n}\n.hi-course-card__format {\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 10px;\n  left: 12px;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-white);\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  padding: 3px 9px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  z-index: 2;\n}\n.hi-course-card__format--ao-vivo   { background: #FF7300; }\n.hi-course-card__format--presencial { background: #C45200; }\n.hi-course-card__format--gravado   { background: #E89C5A; color: #111111; }\n.hi-course-card__body {\n  padding: 18px 18px 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n  flex: 1;\n}\n.hi-course-card__title {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  color: var(--color-white);\n  line-height: 1.25;\n}\n.hi-course-card__text {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.80);\n  flex: 1;\n}\n.hi-course-card__link {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 5px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n.hi-course-card__link::after { content: '→'; }\n.hi-course-card__link:hover { color: var(--color-white); }\n\n.hi-courses__trails {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 40px 48px;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   6. RECURSOS GRATUITOS\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-resources {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-bg-light);\n}\n.hi-resources__header {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 60px;\n  align-items: end;\n  margin-bottom: 60px;\n}\n.hi-resources__eyebrow-wrap {\n  grid-column: 1 / -1;\n}\n.hi-resources__title {\n  font-size: clamp(30px, 3.5vw, 52px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  margin-bottom: 0;\n}\n.hi-resources__intro {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  max-width: 560px;\n  padding-top: 8px;\n}\n.hi-resources__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 0;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-resource-card {\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  padding: 36px 28px;\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.hi-resource-card:last-child { border-right: none; }\n.hi-resource-card::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;\n  height: 3px;\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  transform: scaleX(0);\n  transform-origin: left;\n  transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n}\n.hi-resource-card:hover::after {\n  transform: scaleX(1);\n}\n.hi-resource-card:hover {\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n.hi-resource-card__icon {\n  width: 52px;\n  height: 52px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n.hi-resource-card__icon-img {\n  width: 52px;\n  height: 52px;\n  object-fit: contain;\n  display: block;\n}\n.hi-resource-card__title {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  line-height: 1.3;\n}\n.hi-resource-card__text {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  flex: 1;\n}\n.hi-resource-card__link {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n}\n.hi-resource-card__link::after { content: '→'; }\n.hi-resource-card__link:hover { color: var(--color-orange); }\n\n/* ============================================================\n   7. IMPACTO\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-impact {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-impact__header {\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 72px;\n}\n.hi-impact__title {\n  font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 44px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n.hi-impact__intro {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  max-width: 520px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.hi-impact__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 0;\n  border-top: 2px solid var(--color-black);\n  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-impact-stat {\n  padding: 60px 48px;\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-impact-stat:last-child { border-right: none; }\n.hi-impact-stat__num {\n  font-family: 'Montserrat', inherit, sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(52px, 6vw, 88px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.04em;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  line-height: 1;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n.hi-impact-stat__num span {\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n}\n.hi-impact-stat__label {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n.hi-impact-stat__desc {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  max-width: 260px;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   8. QUOTE\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-quote {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-black);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.hi-quote__inner {\n  text-align: center;\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n  max-width: 820px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.hi-quote__text {\n  font-size: clamp(22px, 3.2vw, 42px);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  color: var(--color-white);\n  margin-bottom: 40px;\n}\n.hi-quote__text em {\n  font-style: normal;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n}\n.hi-quote__line {\n  width: 40px;\n  height: 2px;\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  margin: 0 auto 24px;\n}\n.hi-quote__author {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   9. NEWSLETTER\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-newsletter {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-newsletter__inner {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 80px;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__title {\n  font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 42px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__text {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n}\n.hi-newsletter__form {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__field {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__label {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-newsletter__input {\n  font-family: var(--font-main);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  padding: 14px 18px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  background: var(--color-bg-light);\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  transition: var(--transition);\n  outline: none;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__input:focus {\n  border-color: var(--color-black);\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(17,17,17,0.06);\n}\n.hi-newsletter__checks {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__check {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 10px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n}\n.hi-newsletter__check input[type=\"checkbox\"] {\n  margin-top: 2px;\n  accent-color: var(--color-black);\n  width: 15px;\n  height: 15px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n/* ── HubSpot embed override ── */\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap {\n  background: var(--color-bg-light);\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 36px 32px;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap ul,\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap li {\n  list-style: none !important;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form-field {\n  margin-bottom: 18px !important;\n  list-style: none !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form fieldset {\n  max-width: 100% !important;\n  border: none !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-input:not([type=\"checkbox\"]):not([type=\"radio\"]) {\n  font-family: var(--font-main) !important;\n  font-size: 15px !important;\n  padding: 13px 16px !important;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border) !important;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm) !important;\n  background: var(--color-white) !important;\n  color: var(--color-black) !important;\n  width: 100% !important;\n  outline: none !important;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s ease !important;\n  box-sizing: border-box !important;\n  -webkit-appearance: none !important;\n  appearance: none !important;\n  box-shadow: none !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-input:not([type=\"checkbox\"]):not([type=\"radio\"]):focus {\n  border-color: var(--color-black) !important;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(17,17,17,0.06) !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form label {\n  font-family: var(--font-main) !important;\n  font-size: 11px !important;\n  font-weight: 700 !important;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em !important;\n  text-transform: uppercase !important;\n  color: var(--color-black) !important;\n  margin-bottom: 6px !important;\n  display: block !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .inputs-list {\n  list-style: none !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n  margin: 0 0 12px !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .inputs-list li {\n  list-style: none !important;\n  display: flex !important;\n  align-items: flex-start !important;\n  gap: 10px !important;\n  margin-bottom: 10px !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .inputs-list li::before,\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .inputs-list li::marker {\n  display: none !important;\n  content: none !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .inputs-list input[type=\"checkbox\"] {\n  width: 15px !important;\n  height: 15px !important;\n  flex-shrink: 0 !important;\n  margin-top: 2px !important;\n  accent-color: var(--color-black) !important;\n  cursor: pointer !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .inputs-list label {\n  font-size: 13px !important;\n  font-weight: 400 !important;\n  letter-spacing: 0 !important;\n  text-transform: none !important;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary) !important;\n  line-height: 1.5 !important;\n  cursor: pointer !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-field-desc {\n  font-size: 12px !important;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary) !important;\n  margin-bottom: 8px !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-submit .hs-button,\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form input[type=\"submit\"] {\n  font-family: var(--font-main) !important;\n  font-size: 13px !important;\n  font-weight: 700 !important;\n  letter-spacing: 0.06em !important;\n  text-transform: uppercase !important;\n  background: var(--color-black) !important;\n  color: var(--color-white) !important;\n  border: 2px solid var(--color-black) !important;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm) !important;\n  padding: 14px 32px !important;\n  cursor: pointer !important;\n  transition: background 0.22s ease, border-color 0.22s ease !important;\n  margin-top: 8px !important;\n  width: 100% !important;\n  -webkit-appearance: none !important;\n  appearance: none !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-submit .hs-button:hover,\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form input[type=\"submit\"]:hover {\n  background: var(--color-orange) !important;\n  border-color: var(--color-orange) !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-error-msgs {\n  font-size: 12px !important;\n  color: #c0392b !important;\n  list-style: none !important;\n  margin-top: 4px !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-richtext,\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .hs-form .hs-richtext p {\n  font-size: 12px !important;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary) !important;\n  line-height: 1.5 !important;\n}\n.hi-newsletter__hs-wrap .submitted-message {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  padding: 20px;\n  background: var(--color-orange-soft);\n  border-left: 3px solid var(--color-orange);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   10. CTA B2B FINAL\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-cta-b2b {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-orange);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top right, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 0%, transparent 60%);\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__inner {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr auto;\n  gap: 60px;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__title {\n  font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 46px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__text {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);\n  margin-bottom: 36px;\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__btns {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__person {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__person-img {\n  width: 180px;\n  height: 180px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  object-position: top center;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  display: block;\n  filter: grayscale(20%);\n  transition: filter 0.4s ease;\n  border: 3px solid var(--color-orange);\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__person-img:hover {\n  filter: grayscale(0%);\n}\n.hi-cta-b2b__person-tag {\n  background: var(--color-black);\n  color: var(--color-white);\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 6px 14px;\n  border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   RESPONSIVIDADE\n   ============================================================ */\n@media (max-width: 1024px) {\n  .hi-container { padding: 0 28px; }\n\n  .hi-b2b__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .hi-b2b-card:nth-child(2) { border-right: none; }\n  .hi-b2b-card:nth-child(3) { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }\n  .hi-b2b-card:nth-child(4) { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }\n\n  .hi-resources__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .hi-resource-card:nth-child(2) { border-right: none; }\n  .hi-resource-card:nth-child(3) { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }\n  .hi-resource-card:nth-child(4) { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .hi-container { padding: 0 20px; }\n\n  /* Profiles */\n  .hi-profiles__grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    border: none;\n  }\n  .hi-profile-card {\n    border-right: none;\n    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n\n  /* B2B */\n  .hi-b2b__top { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }\n  .hi-b2b__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .hi-b2b-card { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }\n  .hi-b2b-card:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n  .hi-b2b__cta { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }\n\n  /* Cases */\n  .hi-cases__header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }\n  .hi-cases__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n\n  /* Cursos */\n  .hi-courses__trails { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }\n  .hi-courses__header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }\n  .hi-trail__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n\n  /* Resources */\n  .hi-resources__header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }\n  .hi-resources__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; border: none; }\n  .hi-resource-card { border-right: none; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); margin-bottom: 12px; }\n\n  /* Impact */\n  .hi-impact__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; border-top: none; border-bottom: none; }\n  .hi-impact-stat {\n    border-right: none;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n    padding: 40px 0;\n  }\n  .hi-impact-stat:first-child { border-top: 2px solid var(--color-black); }\n  .hi-impact-stat:last-child { border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-black); }\n\n  /* Newsletter */\n  .hi-newsletter__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }\n\n  /* CTA B2B */\n  .hi-cta-b2b__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }\n  .hi-cta-b2b__btns { flex-direction: column; }\n  .hi-cta-b2b__person { display: none; }\n\n  /* FAQ */\n  .hi-faq__header { margin-bottom: 32px; }\n}\n\n/* Reduced motion — pausa o vídeo */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .hi-hero__video { animation: none; }\n  .hi-hero__scroll-line { animation: none; }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   11. FAQ\n   ============================================================ */\n.hi-faq {\n  padding: 100px 0;\n  background: var(--color-bg-light);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-faq__header {\n  margin-bottom: 52px;\n}\n.hi-faq__title {\n  font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 42px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n.hi-faq__intro {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  max-width: 540px;\n}\n.hi-faq__list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.hi-faq__item {\n  background: var(--color-white);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-faq__item:last-child {\n  border-bottom: none;\n}\n.hi-faq__question {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--color-black);\n  padding: 24px 28px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  list-style: none;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 16px;\n  transition: var(--transition);\n  user-select: none;\n}\n.hi-faq__question::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n.hi-faq__question::after {\n  content: '+';\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  transition: transform 0.25s ease;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n.hi-faq__item[open] .hi-faq__question::after {\n  transform: rotate(45deg);\n}\n.hi-faq__item[open] .hi-faq__question {\n  color: var(--color-orange);\n}\n.hi-faq__item:hover .hi-faq__question {\n  background: var(--color-bg-light);\n}\n.hi-faq__item[open] {\n  background: var(--color-white);\n}\n.hi-faq__answer {\n  padding: 0 28px 24px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n}\n.hi-faq__answer p {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.75;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  padding-top: 20px;\n  max-width: 720px;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"hi-home-redesign\">\n\n  <!-- ============================================================\n       1. HERO PRINCIPAL — VIDEO BACKGROUND\n       ============================================================ -->\n  <section class=\"hi-hero\" aria-label=\"Hero principal\">\n\n    <!-- ── DESKTOP ONLY: vídeo background + overlay ── -->\n    <video class=\"hi-hero__video\" autoplay=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsinline=\"\" preload=\"auto\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <source src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/7f432c89c58a4e7ab4e81b15de3ebf0a.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n    </source></video>\n    <div class=\"hi-hero__overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hi-hero__bottom-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n    <!-- ── CONTEÚDO (desktop: sobre o vídeo | mobile: abaixo da imagem) ── -->\n    <div class=\"hi-hero__inner\">\n      <div class=\"hi-container\">\n\n        <div class=\"hi-hero__mobile-grid\">\n\n          <!-- Coluna de imagem — visível só no mobile -->\n          <div class=\"hi-hero__image-col\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/1_Header_Cursos.jpg?v=1752072621\" alt=\"Equipe em experiência de aprendizagem colaborativa na Hyper Island\" class=\"hi-hero__img\">\n            <span class=\"hi-hero__badge-mobile\">Global · Since 1996</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Conteúdo textual -->\n          <div class=\"hi-hero__content hi-reveal\">\n\n            <span class=\"hi-hero__eyebrow\">Business Transformation &amp; Learning</span>\n\n            <h1 class=\"hi-hero__title\">\n              Aprenda a liderar,<br>\n              inovar e <em>decidir</em><br>\n              num mundo em<br>\n              transformação.\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"hi-hero__subtitle\">\n              A Hyper Island desenvolve pessoas, times e organizações por meio de\n              experiências de aprendizagem, facilitação e transformação com\n              impacto real nos negócios.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"hi-hero__ctas\">\n              <a href=\"https://www.hyperisland.com.br/pages/empresas\" class=\"hi-btn hi-btn-primary\">Soluções para empresas</a>\n              <a href=\"https://www.hyperisland.com.br/pages/cursos\" class=\"hi-btn hi-btn-outline\">Conheça nossos cursos</a>\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Badge desktop (canto inferior direito) -->\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:28px;left:0;right:0;max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px;width:100%;z-index:3;\">\n      <span class=\"hi-hero__badge\">Global · Since 1996</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Indicador de scroll (desktop) -->\n    <div class=\"hi-hero__scroll\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"hi-hero__scroll-line\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ============================================================\n       2. BARRA DE ESCOLHA POR PERFIL\n       ============================================================ -->\n  <section class=\"hi-profiles\" aria-label=\"Para quem é a Hyper Island\">\n    <div class=\"hi-container\">\n      <div class=\"hi-profiles__header hi-reveal\">\n        <span class=\"hi-eyebrow\">Por onde começar</span>\n        <h2 class=\"hi-profiles__title\">Qual é o seu caminho?</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hi-profiles__grid\">\n\n        <article class=\"hi-profile-card hi-reveal hi-reveal-delay-1\">\n          <div class=\"hi-profile-card__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</div>\n          <h3 class=\"hi-profile-card__title\">Para indivíduos</h3>\n          <p class=\"hi-profile-card__text\">\n            Cursos intensivos para desenvolver novas habilidades em liderança,\n            comunicação, futuros, inovação e inteligência artificial.\n          </p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.hyperisland.com.br/pages/cursos\" class=\"hi-profile-card__link\">Ver cursos</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"hi-profile-card hi-reveal hi-reveal-delay-2\">\n          <div class=\"hi-profile-card__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</div>\n          <h3 class=\"hi-profile-card__title\">Para empresas</h3>\n          <p class=\"hi-profile-card__text\">\n            Jornadas customizadas para desenvolver cultura, liderança, inovação,\n            estratégia e transformação digital.\n          </p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.hyperisland.com.br/pages/empresas\" class=\"hi-profile-card__link\">Transformar minha organização</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"hi-profile-card hi-reveal hi-reveal-delay-3\">\n          <div class=\"hi-profile-card__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</div>\n          <h3 class=\"hi-profile-card__title\">Para explorar agora</h3>\n          <p class=\"hi-profile-card__text\">\n            Ferramentas, assessments, artigos e recursos gratuitos para aplicar\n            novas práticas com seu time.\n          </p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.hyperisland.com.br/pages/recursos-gratuitos\" class=\"hi-profile-card__link\">Acessar recursos</a>\n        </article>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ============================================================\n       3. BUSINESS TRANSFORMATION\n       ============================================================ -->\n  <section class=\"hi-b2b\" aria-label=\"Soluções para empresas\">\n    <div class=\"hi-container\">\n      <div class=\"hi-b2b__top\">\n        <div class=\"hi-reveal\">\n          <span class=\"hi-eyebrow\">Para empresas</span>\n          <h2 class=\"hi-b2b__title\">\n            Construímos organizações mais preparadas para o futuro.\n          </h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hi-b2b__intro hi-reveal hi-reveal-delay-2\">\n          <p>\n            Ajudamos empresas a transformar desafios complexos em experiências\n            de aprendizagem, colaboração e ação. Nossas jornadas combinam\n            facilitação, estratégia e desenvolvimento humano para gerar mudança\n            real no trabalho.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hi-b2b__grid\">\n\n        <article class=\"hi-b2b-card hi-b2b-card--has-portfolio hi-reveal hi-reveal-delay-1\">\n          <div class=\"hi-b2b-card__marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n          <h3 class=\"hi-b2b-card__title\">Visão de Futuro &amp; Estratégia</h3>\n          <p class=\"hi-b2b-card__text\">\n            Transforme incerteza em direção estratégica. Ajudamos organizações\n            a interpretar sinais, explorar cenários e tomar decisões mais\n            consistentes em contextos de mudança.\n          </p>\n          <a href=\"https://hyperisland.com/hubfs/%5BPT%5D%20Futures%20&amp;%20Strategy%20Portfolio%202026.pdf\" class=\"hi-b2b-card__portfolio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Acessar portfolio</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"hi-b2b-card hi-b2b-card--has-portfolio hi-reveal hi-reveal-delay-2\">\n          <div class=\"hi-b2b-card__marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n          <h3 class=\"hi-b2b-card__title\">Liderança &amp; Cultura</h3>\n          <p class=\"hi-b2b-card__text\">\n            Desenvolva líderes e times capazes de colaborar melhor, assumir\n            responsabilidade, criar segurança psicológica e agir com mais\n            autonomia.\n          </p>\n          <a href=\"https://hyperisland.com/hubfs/%5BPT%5D%20Hyper%20Island%20-%20Leadership%20&amp;%20Culture%20portfolio.pdf\" class=\"hi-b2b-card__portfolio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Acessar portfolio</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"hi-b2b-card hi-reveal hi-reveal-delay-3\">\n          <div class=\"hi-b2b-card__marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n          <h3 class=\"hi-b2b-card__title\">Inovação &amp; Criatividade</h3>\n          <p class=\"hi-b2b-card__text\">\n            Desenvolva a capacidade de criar, testar e evoluir soluções\n            relevantes, conectando colaboração, experimentação e comportamento\n            humano real.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"hi-b2b-card hi-reveal hi-reveal-delay-4\">\n          <div class=\"hi-b2b-card__marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n          <h3 class=\"hi-b2b-card__title\">Tecnologia Emergente &amp; Transformação</h3>\n          <p class=\"hi-b2b-card__text\">\n            Prepare pessoas e decisões para um mundo moldado por inteligência\n            artificial, novas tecnologias e mudanças aceleradas nos modelos\n            de trabalho.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hi-b2b__cta hi-reveal\">\n        <p class=\"hi-b2b__cta-text\">Pronto para transformar a sua organização?</p>\n        <a href=\"https://www.hyperisland.com.br/pages/empresas\" class=\"hi-btn hi-btn-primary\">Conheça nossas soluções para empresas</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ============================================================\n       4. CASES E PROVA SOCIAL\n       ============================================================ -->\n  <section class=\"hi-cases\" aria-label=\"Cases de transformação\">\n    <div class=\"hi-container\">\n      <div class=\"hi-cases__header\">\n        <div class=\"hi-reveal\">\n          <span class=\"hi-eyebrow\">Impacto real</span>\n          <h2 class=\"hi-cases__title\">\n            Transformação aplicada em organizações reais.\n          </h2>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"hi-cases__intro hi-reveal hi-reveal-delay-2\">\n          A Hyper Island trabalha com empresas que precisam desenvolver novas\n          capacidades, alinhar times e responder a mudanças complexas com mais\n          clareza, colaboração e ação.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hi-cases__grid\">\n\n        <article class=\"hi-case-card hi-reveal hi-reveal-delay-1\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6904.jpg?v=1778694423\" alt=\"Case Grupo Boticário — Estratégia de Marketing\" class=\"hi-case-card__img\">\n          <div class=\"hi-case-card__body\">\n            <div class=\"hi-case-card__meta\">\n              <span class=\"hi-case-card__company\">Grupo Boticário</span>\n              <span class=\"hi-case-card__cat\">Estratégia de Marketing</span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"hi-case-card__text